      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "水所得到的热量为",
        "$Q_2=c_2m_2(t_2-t_1)$，",
        "$Q_2=4200\\frac{\\text{焦耳}}{\\text{千克}\\cdot{}^\\circ\\mathrm{C}}\\times20\\text{千克}\\times90^\\circ\\mathrm{C}=7560000\\text{焦耳}↵\\approx7600\\text{千焦耳}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，对锅及水加热的结果，共传递给它们的热量为",
        "$Q=Q_1+Q_2$，",
        "$Q=400\\text{千焦耳}+7600\\text{千焦耳}=8000\\text{千焦耳}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**例题2.** 把0.8千克温度为$25^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$的冷水与0.2千克的沸",
        "水混合在一起. 经测定，混合后的温度为$40^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$. 试计算沸水",
        "在温度降低的过程中放出了多少热量，以及冷水在温度升高",
        "的过程中得到了多少热量. 把这两个热量加以比较."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "沸水的温度从$100^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$降低到$40^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，在这个过程中它放出",
        "的热量为",
        "$Q_1=c_1m_1(t_2-t_1)$，",
        "$Q_1=4200\\frac{\\text{焦耳}}{\\text{千克}\\cdot{}^\\circ\\mathrm{C}}\\times0.2\\text{千克}\\times(100-40)^\\circ\\mathrm{C}↵=50400\\text{焦耳}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "被注入沸水的冷水的温度从$25^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$升到$40^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$，所得到的",
        "热量为",
        "$Q_2=c_2m_2(t_2-t_1)$，"
      ]
    },
